# Three small houses side by side become one large house; a fourth stays its own.
new empty
free on
construction off
build house at s0:40
build house next
build house next
expect count house 1
expect at s0:40 house size 3 done
build house next
expect count house 2
map ids

# Pulling down the middle section of a large house leaves two small ones.
new empty
free on
construction off
build house at s0:40
build house next
build house next
demolish section at s0:43
run 1s
expect count house 2
expect at s0:40 house size 1
expect at s0:46 house size 1
map ids

# With builders: three houses built side by side merge as each one is finished.
new village
build house at s0:79
build house next
build house next
expect at s0:79 house constructing
run until built
expect at s0:79 house size 3 done
expect at s0:85 house size 1 done
map ids D60:-C99

# Pulling down a section, what is left merges with a small house beside it,
# as a new one built there would.
new empty
free on
construction off
build house at s0:40
build house next
build house next
build house next
expect at s0:49 house size 1
demolish section at s0:43
run 1s
expect count house 2
expect at s0:40 house size 1
expect at s0:46 house size 2
map ids
